 "stimulus_html": "Use the Venn diagram below to answer the following questions.<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/ad58ab09227f1671.png\" alt=\"A three-set Venn diagram of A, B, and C overlapping one another is given. Set A shows 7, set B shows 3 and set C shows 12. Overlapping of sets A and B shows 4, overlapping of sets B and C shows 8, and overlapping of A and C plus shows 5. Overlapping of A, B, and C shows 2. Outside the intersection of Venn diagrams, 6 is marked. The union of the Venn diagram is 47.\">\n",
